      "id": 89737,
      "name": "broccoli",
      "username": "broccoli",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/broccoli/{size}/1861_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-02-07T04:04:08.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, this might actually be doable. &nbsp;They'd play a card each turn, and MAYBE do a secondary effect, based on the type of card played. &nbsp;V5 decks only have 20 cards, but if you remove the shrine and the 4 cards that add new Ennead members, that's done. &nbsp;So figuring out what H should be (H-1 or H-2 as McBehrer said) is really all it would take, and they already have incapacitated effects. &nbsp;On the plus side, they'd play very fast compared to other V5 members, because they have no ongoings or minions.</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:14:52.097Z",
